  "description": "Kwon U-Jae and Baek Yu-Hyeon became family when their parents remarried. Having grown up relying on each other in a cold, unwelcoming home, the two begin a secret romance, one they can’t tell anyone about, after their first kiss. However, a sudden breakup leaves U-Jae with resentment and Yu-Hyeon with longing… Ten years later, the two reunite in an unexpected place.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
